@startuml
title Protected Endpoint Authorization (Bearer)

actor Client
participant "Protected API endpoint" as API
participant "OpaqueTokenIntrospector" as Intro
participant "Keycloak\n/token/introspect" as KC
participant "DPoP Filter" as DPoP

Client -> API: Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
opt DPoP proof header provided
  Client -> API: DPoP: <proof-jwt>
end

API -> Intro: introspect(access_token)
Intro -> KC: POST /token/introspect
KC --> Intro: active + roles + optional cnf.jkt
Intro --> API: Authentication + ROLE_*

opt cnf.jkt present
  API -> DPoP: validate provided DPoP proof\nhtm/htu/iat/jti/ath + thumbprint binding
  DPoP --> API: allow or deny
end

API --> Client: AppResponse | 401 | 403

@enduml
